# Test Results Directory
# Files created here during automated test execution:
# - test-implementation-steps.md    (What was tested)
# - test-verdict.md                 (Pass/Fail/Partial verdict + evidence table)
# - execution-log.txt               (Timeline, VERIFIED vs UNVERIFIED)
# - test-report.html                (Printable source for the PDF)
# - test-report.pdf                 (General status, step-by-step, failed
#                                     steps, recommendations - 4 tables)
# - deployment-outputs.md           (SENSITIVE - credentials, DNS, IPs, certs.
#                                     Gitignored. Deleted at teardown, every
#                                     time. Never referenced from the files
#                                     above, which are meant to be shared.)
